From: AosEdge SDV Demo <demo@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] iamserver: size permission reply by functions, not services

GetPermissions returns functions within one functional service. Using the
functional-service count (16) rejects valid permission sets of 17..32 entries
that RegisterInstance accepts. Keep all permission contents and policy intact.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/src/iam/iamserver/publicmessagehandler.cpp
+++ b/src/iam/iamserver/publicmessagehandler.cpp
@@ -1,1 +1,1 @@
-    auto          aosInstancePerm = std::make_unique<StaticArray<FunctionPermissions, cFuncServiceMaxCount>>();
+    auto          aosInstancePerm = std::make_unique<StaticArray<FunctionPermissions, cFunctionsMaxCount>>();
